// CHECK: 33:5: error: 'a' was passed to a collective, which published it: every iteration may read any of its cells and none may wri
// CHECK: 40:7: error: every iteration must reach this call of the collective 'exchange' in the same order, but it is reached only wh
// CHECK: 46:5: error: a while loop cannot hold a collective yet: use a for loop over a uniform range (ADR 0086)
// CHECK: 51:53: error: 'total' runs once for every iteration, so this argument must be the same in each, and it depends on the iterat
// CHECK: 53:40: error: a gathered parameter is an array over a range parameter, '(r : range) (x : [t; r])', which holds every iterati
// CHECK: 55:72: error: a collective takes no out, inout or mutable parameter: it runs once for every iteration, so what it writes wou
